      "born": 1798,
      "died": 1914,
      "born_confidence": "approximate",
      "died_confidence": "attested",
      "region": "Europe",
      "note": "A private post with its own riders, boats and, in the family's own telling, pigeons. It carried prices between the five houses faster than any government could learn them, and the advantage was not the secrecy but the hours.",
