      "lng": null,
      "born": 1810,
      "died": 1905,
      "born_confidence": "approximate",
      "died_confidence": "attested",
      "region": "Europe",
      "note": "Renewed by contract every few years between brothers and then cousins, keeping the capital pooled across five jurisdictions and out of any single court's reach. Marriage inside the family kept it there.",
